[
  {
    "source": "- You can now disarm traps by pressing [d] and choosing a direction (works both for traps on the ground and on chests)",
    "target": "- 现在可以按 [d] 并选择方向来解除陷阱（地面和箱子上的陷阱都适用）",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1152"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "- You can now only accidentally drop your melee weapon during combat if you are Cursed",
    "target": "- 现在只有受诅咒时，战斗中才会意外丢下近战武器",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:927"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "- You can throw potions",
    "target": "- 现在可以投掷药剂",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1618"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "- You lost iron spikes if you tried to jam an open door",
    "target": "- 尝试卡住敞开的门时不再会丢失铁钉",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1594"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "- You no longer automatically reload your weapon when attempting to fire an empty gun (though there is a setting in the options menu to enable this again). The reason is that it was too easy to reload by accident.",
    "target": "- 尝试射击空枪时不再自动装填（不过可在选项菜单中重新启用此设置）。这样做是因为意外装填太容易发生。",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1234"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "- You no longer choose Medical Bag actions through a popup menu, instead it first sanitizes an infection if you have one, otherwise it restores HP.",
    "target": "- 医疗包操作不再通过弹出菜单选择；若有感染，会先消毒，否则恢复生命值。",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1071"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "- You no longer drop your items when you die",
    "target": "- 死亡时不再丢失物品",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:883"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "- You no longer gain XP from killing monsters - instead XP is raised by activities related to exploration and discovery, such as identifying items, drinking from some types of fountains, reading inscriptions on \"monoliths\", or seeing a new type of monster for the first time",
    "target": "- 击杀怪物不再获得经验值；现在通过探索与发现相关的活动提升经验，例如鉴定物品、饮用某些喷泉、阅读“石碑”上的铭文，或首次见到某类怪物",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:794"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "- You no longer pick an ability when creating a new character",
    "target": "- 创建新角色时不再选择能力",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1261"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "- You now also go to the postmortem menu after winning the game, and a game summary file is written",
    "target": "- 现在获胜后也会进入死后菜单，并写入一份游戏摘要文件",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:771"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "- You now gain half a monsters worth of experience when spotting it, and the other half when killing it (killing a monster without spotting it gives the full worth)",
    "target": "- 现在发现怪物时可获得一半经验，击杀时获得另一半（未发现就击杀则获得全部经验）",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1113"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "- You now gain the mythos spell at 15% MTH instead of 10%",
    "target": "- 现在 MTH 达到 15% 时获得神话法术，而不是 10%",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1264"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "- You now pick traits when gaining character levels (as it was in v14) instead of only at the start. Many new traits have been added. You pick a trait each level, but the XP rate is roughly halved compared to older versions, and your character is limited to 10 levels.",
    "target": "- 现在角色升级时选择特质（与 v14 相同），而不是只在游戏开始时选择。新增了许多特质。每级选择一个特质；经验获取速度约为旧版本的一半，角色最高升至 10 级。",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1109"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "- You now start with a fixed number of items (instead of a random range), and your starting items depend more on the chosen background (e.g. the Rogue always starts with a +1 Dagger).",
    "target": "- 现在初始物品数量固定（不再随机浮动），且初始物品更取决于所选背景（例如，盗贼总会以一把 +1 匕首开始）。",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1044"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "- You search for secret doors and traps a bit further away, and your chance of finding them is affected by distance - for adjacent cells there is now a higher chance of detection than before (to avoid requiring hundreds of turns to detect an obvious hidden door)",
    "target": "- 搜索秘密门和陷阱的范围稍远；发现几率受距离影响。相邻格现在更容易被发现（避免为了发现明显的隐藏门而搜索数百回合）。",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:830"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "- Your insanity no longer rises immediately when shock is at 100% or more, instead you now first have three turns with warning messages - during these turns you have a chance to reduce shock below 100% (e.g. by turning on a light in a dark room, drinking a Potion of Fortitude, descending the stairs, or stepping away from a ghoulish statue)",
    "target": "- 理智错乱不再会在震慑达到 100% 或更高时立即上升；现在会先有三回合的警告信息，你可以趁机将震慑降到 100% 以下（例如在黑暗房间开灯、饮用坚韧药剂、下楼，或远离食尸鬼雕像）。",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1123"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "- Your inventory is no longer limited by the number of items (only by weight)",
    "target": "- 背包不再受物品数量限制（只受重量限制）",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1042"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "- Zombie-corpses can rise again.",
    "target": "- 僵尸尸体可能再次站起来。",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1932"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "- Zombie-type monsters occasionally drop \"Zombie Dust\" when they are destroyed - can be thrown at living, non-undead monsters to paralyze them",
    "target": "- 僵尸类怪物被消灭时偶尔会掉落“僵尸粉尘”；可投向活着的非亡灵怪物，使其麻痹",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:839"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "- Zombies leave no corpse the second time they are killed",
    "target": "- 僵尸第二次被杀死时不会留下尸体",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1771"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
