  },
  {
    "source": "> And a few more...",
    "target": "> 以及其他改动……",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1682"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "> Arcana - gives better chances to cast spells from memory without failure",
    "target": "> 奥术：提高不失败地施放记忆法术的几率",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1553"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "> Armor stats are shown in the character info lines",
    "target": "> 护甲属性显示在角色信息行中",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1543"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "> Armors are named \"Name [D%, AP]\", where D=Durability, AP=Damage reduction (vs physical)",
    "target": "> 护甲名称格式为“名称 [D%, AP]”，其中 D 为耐久度，AP 为伤害减免（对物理伤害）",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1542"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "> Armors can be damaged, which makes it less effective",
    "target": "> 护甲会受到损坏，导致防护效果降低",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1541"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "> Armors provide different amount of protection from different damage types (physical, fire, electricity, etc)",
    "target": "> 护甲对不同伤害类型（物理、火焰、电击等）提供不同程度的防护",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1540"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "> Blood (slower walk speed, doge penalty, causes shock)",
    "target": "> 血液（移动速度较慢、闪避受罚，并造成震慑）",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1678"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "> Casting spells from memory drains Spirit Points, it can also cause miscasts with negative effects",
    "target": "> 凭记忆施法会消耗精神值，也可能发生造成负面效果的施法失误",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1548"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "> Chance to identify or memorize depends on the language ability",
    "target": "> 鉴定或记忆法术的几率取决于语言能力",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1547"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "> Chasm (only flying creatures can pass)",
    "target": "> 裂隙（只有飞行生物能够通过）",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1681"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "> Crypt that you climb out of.",
    "target": "> 你爬出来的墓窖。",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1937"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "> Graveyard.",
    "target": "> 墓园。",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1938"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "> Lore(Alchemy) - Used for identifying potions.",
    "target": "> 学识（炼金术）——用于鉴定药剂。",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1610"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "> Lore(Language) - Used for identifying scrolls.",
    "target": "> 学识（语言）——用于鉴定卷轴。",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1611"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "> Mud (much slower walk speed, heavy dodge penalty)",
    "target": "> 泥地（移动速度大幅降低，闪避受到严重惩罚）",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1680"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "> Projectiles can miss their target and hit someone behind it instead.",
    "target": "> 投射物可能会射偏目标，击中其后方的人。",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1957"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "> Putting points in one skill gives half the amount to all other skills in the same group",
    "target": "> 将点数投入一项技能时，同组其他技能也会获得一半点数",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1608"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "> Reloading - Chance to get a free turn when reloading firearms",
    "target": "> 装填——装填枪械时获得免费回合的几率",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1555"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "> Scrolls (now called manuscripts) can be studied to be identified or memorized (to cast them at any time)",
    "target": "> 卷轴（现称手稿）可通过研读来鉴定或记忆（以便随时施放）",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1546"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "> Some monsters will search for you if they saw you.",
    "target": "> 某些怪物看到你后会搜寻你。",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1928"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "> Some skills have been split (e.g. Firearms->Shotguns, Pistols, Automatics)",
    "target": "> 部分技能已拆分（例如枪械拆分为霰弹枪、手枪和自动武器）",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1605"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "> Some will communicate about where to search.",
    "target": "> 有些怪物会交流搜寻方向。",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1930"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "> Some will listen for sounds.",
    "target": "> 有些怪物会聆听声音。",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1929"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "> Spirit - increases max Spirit Points",
    "target": "> 精神：提高精神值上限",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1552"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "> Technique (melee) - Chance to get free turn (light weapons), full damage (heavy), or random bonus (medium)",
    "target": "> 技法（近战）——有几率获得免费回合（轻型武器）、造成全额伤害（重型武器）或随机加成（中型武器）",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1554"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "> The 'R'-key is used for studying texts, 'x' for casting from memory, and 'X' for casting from manuscripts",
    "target": "> ‘R’键用于研读文本，‘x’键用于凭记忆施法，‘X’键用于施放手稿中的法术",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1549"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "> The skills are ordered in groups (e.g. Stealth = Sneaking and Backstabbing)",
    "target": "> 技能按组排列（例如潜行组包括潜行和背刺）",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1607"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "> Water (slower walk speed, dodge penalty)",
    "target": "> 水中（移动速度较慢，闪避受罚）",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1677"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "> You assign points instead of ranks",
    "target": "> 分配点数，而不是选择等级",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1606"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "> You can aim the Napalm Launcher at the ground.",
    "target": "> 可以将凝固汽油发射器瞄准地面。",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/release_history.txt:1958"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
